<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="NEH" style="id">Nehemiah</book>
  <para style="h">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nehemiah</para>
  <para style="mt">Nehemiah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hakalia fapa Nehemia thute chu. Heti hi a ni a, kum sawmhnihna, Kisleu thlaa lal khawpui Susan-a ka awm laiin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka unau pakhat Hanania leh Judai ram ata mi ṭhenkhat an lo kal a; tin, Juda-ho sala tâng chhuak la damte chanchin leh Jerusalem chanchin ka zâwt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, ka hnênah, “Sala tâng chhuak, chumi rama dama la awmte chu chan chhe tak leh sawichhiatin an awm a. Jerusalem kulh chu a chim rem rum tawh a, a kawngkhârte pawh a kâng asin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chûng thu chu ka hriat chuan ka ṭhu chawt a, ka ṭap a, ni eng emaw zât chu lungngaiin ka awm a; tin, chaw ka nghei a, vân Pathian hmaah ka ṭawngṭai a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Aw Lalpa , vân Pathian, Pathian ropui leh hlauhawm, nangmah hmangaiha i thupêk pawmtute chunga thuthlung hlena khawngaihna tilangtu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israela thlahte sualna, i chunga kan sualna thupha ka chawi chhûng hian i beng lo chhiin i mit lo meng la, i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina, i hnêna a chhûn a zâna i chhiahhlawh Israela thlahte ka ngensakna hi lo ngaithla teh ang che; kei leh ka pa chhûngte chu kan lo sual ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I chungah ṭha lo takin thil kan lo ti ta a, i chhiahhlawh Mosia hnêna i pêk, thupêkte, dânte, rorêlte chu kan lo zâwm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Mosia hnêna, ‘In bawhchhiat chuan hnam tin zîngah ka tiṭaiṭâm ang che u a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />amaherawhchu, ka lam in lo hawi leha, ka thupêkte in pawma in zawm chuan, in zînga mi vân tâwp thleng pawha hnawh chhuah awm mah sela, chûng ata pawh chu ka kai khâwm leh ang a, ka hming ka awmtîrna tûra ka ruat hmunah chuan ka hruai leh ang,’ tia thu i pêk kha khawngaih takin hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, hêngho hi i chhiahhlawhte leh i mite, i thiltihtheihna nasa tak leh i kut chak taka i tlan chhuahte an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin i chhiahhlawh ṭawngṭaina leh i hming ṭih lâwm zâwnga neih, i chhiahhlawhte ṭawngṭainaah hian i beng lo chhi ang che; tin, vawiinah hian i chhiahhlawh hi min hlawhtlintîr la, he mi mit hmuhah hian khawngaih takin zahngaihna dawntîr ang che,” ka ti a. Kei chu lal no hlântu ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Lal Artazerzia kum sawmhnih a lal kum, Nisan thlaah uain an rawn hlui hnuin uain chu ka la a, lal chu ka pe a. Tûn hma lam chuan a hmaah lungngai hmêl ka pu ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan ka hnênah, “I damlo pawh a ni si lo va, engtizia nge lungngai hmêl i put chu le? Thil dang a ni lo vang, i rilru lam a lungngai a nih hi maw,” mi ti a. Chutichuan, ka hlau ta êm êm mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan lal hnênah, “Lal chu kumkhuain dam reng rawh se! Mi thlahtute thlân awmna khua chu a ramin a kawngkhârte chu a kâng vek si a, lungngai hmêl pu lo thei em ka nih ang?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, lal chuan ka hnênah, “Eng nge ni i dîl?” a ti a. Chutichuan, vân Pathian hnênah ka ṭawngṭai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lal hnênah chuan, “Lal remtih zâwng a niha, i chhiahhlawh hian i mit ka lo tlun ṭhin chuan, Judai ramah mi thlahtute thlân awmna khuaah mi kaltîr la, khua chu ka va din leh ang e,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, lal chuan ka hnênah (lalnu pawh a kiangah chuan a ṭhu a), “Eng chen nge i thang ang a, eng tikah nge i lo haw leh ang?” a ti a. Chutichuan, lal chuan lâwm takin mi kaltîr ta a; tin, keiin hunbi ka tiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu chauh chu ni lovin lal hnênah chuan, “Lal remtih zâwng a nih chuan, lui râla rorêltute hmuh atân Judai ram ka thlen thlenga mi kaltîr zêl phalna tûrin lehkhate mi pe la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, lal ngaw hâk vêngtu Asapha hmuh tûrin in vênna kulhbîng kawngkhâr rel atân te, khawpui kulh atân te, ka va luah tûr in atân te thing mi pêk theihna tûrin lehkha mi pe bawk rawh,” ka ti a. Tin, ka Pathianin mi duhsak avângin lal hnêna ka dîl ang zêlin mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, lui râla rorêltute hnên chu ka han thleng a, lal lehkhate chu ka han pe a. Tin, lal chuan ka hnênah sipai hotute leh sipai sakawr chung chuang mite a kaltîr ve a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Horon mi Sanbalata leh Amon mi, chhiahhlawh Tobia-ten an lo hriat chuan, Israela thlahte thawvenna ngaihtuah tûrin mi an lo kal zu nia, tiin an lo lungni lo hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jerusalem ka han thleng a, ni thum ka han awm phawt a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, zânah chuan ka tho va, kei leh mi dang tlêm tête nên; Jerusalem tâna ka tih tûr ka Pathianin ka rilrua a dah chu tu mah ka hrilh lo va, ka chuanna sa ngawt lo chu sa dang kan keng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, zânah chuan Ruam Kawngkaah ka chhuak a, Dragon Tuichhunchhuah lam leh Bawlhhlawh Kawngka lamah ka kal a, Jerusalem kulh chim leh a kawngkhâr kângte chu ka en vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Tuichhunchhuah Kawngka leh Lal Dîl thlengin ka kal zêl a; nimahsela, ka chuanna sa kal tlang theihna rêng rêng a awm lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, zânah lui ka zawh chho va, kulh chu ka en a; tin, ka lêt leh a, Ruam Kawngkaah chuan ka lût a, chutiang chuan ka haw leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rorêltute chuan khawiah nge ka kala, eng nge ka tih pawh an hre lo; tin, Juda-te, puithiamte, mi ṭhate, rorêltute leh mi dang hnathawktu tûr rêng rêng pawh ka la hrilh rih lo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, an hnênah, “Kan chan a chhiatzia hi in hmu a, Jerusalem a ram tih te, a kawngkhârte a kâng tih te pawh in hria a; hawh u, sawi chhiat kan nih tawh loh nân Jerusalem kulh chu i din leh ang u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ka Pathian mi duhsak thûte ka hrilh a, ka hnêna lal thusawite pawh. Tin, anni chuan, “I tho vang u khai; i din teh tak ang u,” an ti a. Chutichuan, chu hna ṭha thawk tûr chuan an kut an tichak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Horon mi Sanbalata leh Amon mi, chhiahhlawh Tobia leh Arab mi Geseman an hriat chuan, min nuihzatbûr a, min hmusit a, “In thiltih hi eng tizia nge ni? Lal chungah in hel elo ni?” te min ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, anni chu ka chhâng a, an hnênah, “Vân Pathian chuan mi tihmuingîl ang a; chutichuan, keini a chhiahhlawhte chu kan tho vang a, kan din ang a; nangni erawh chuan Jerusalem-ah hian chanvo emaw, thuneihna emaw, hnuhma emaw in nei lo rêng rêng,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, puithiam lal Eliasiba chu a unau puithiamte nên chuan an tho va, Berâm Kawngka chu an siam a; an tithianghlim a, a kawngkhârte an siam a; Hamea in sâng thlengin an tithianghlim a, Hananela in sâng thleng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, a dawt chu Jeriko miten an siam a. Tin, anmahni dawt chu Imria fapa Zakuran a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, Sangha Kawngka chu Hasena fapaten an siam a; a relte an dah a, a kawngkhârte an rel a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate an rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, anni dawt chu Hakoza fa Uria fapa Meremothan a siam ṭha a. Tin, anni dawt chu Mesezabela fa Berekia fapa Mesulaman a siam ṭha a. Tin, anni dawt chu Baana fapa Zadokan a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, anni dawt Teko-hovin an siam ṭha a; nimahsela, an mi liante chuan an hotu hnaah chuan an ring an rawlh ve duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Kawngka Hlui chu Pasea fapa Joiada leh Besodeia fapa Mesulaman an siam ṭha a, a relte an dah a, a kawngkhârte an rel a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate an rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, anni dawt chu Gibeon mi Melatia leh Meronoth mi Jadonan lui râl ram awptu thu hnuaia awm Gibeon mi leh Mizpa mite nên an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dawt chu rangkachak chhertu zînga mi Harhaia fapa Uzielan a siam ṭha a. Tin, a dawt lehah chuan rimtui siamtu zînga mi Hananian a siam ṭha a, Kulh Chhah thlengin Jerusalem chu an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, anni dawt chu Jerusalem bial chanve hotu Hura fapa Rephaian a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, anni dawt chu Harumapha fapa Jedaian a in zâwn a siam ṭha a. Tin, a dawt chu Hasabneia fapa Hatusan a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Harima fapa Malkija leh Pahath-moaba fapa Hasuba-te chuan hmun dang leh Meipui Chhehna In sâng an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, a dawt chu Jerusalem bial chanve hotu Hallohesa fapa Saluman a fanute nên an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ruam Kawngka chu Hanuna leh Zanoa-hoten an siam ṭha a; an siam a, a kawngkhârte an rel a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate an rem a; tin, Bawlhhlawh Kawngka thlengin kulh tawng sângkhat an siam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawlhhlawh Kawngka erawh chu Beth-hakkerem bial hotu Rekaba fapa Malkijan a siam ṭha a; a siam a, kawngkhârte a rel a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate a rem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Mizpa bial hotu Kol-hozea fapa Sallunan Tuikhur Kawngka chu a siam ṭha a; a siam a, a khuh a, a kawngkhârte a rel a, a kalhnate leh a bahnate a rem a; tin, Lal Huan kianga Sela Dîl hungna chu Davida khua aṭanga chhuk thla kailâwn thlengin a siam ṭha bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, a dawt chu Azbuka, Beth-zur bial chanve hotu fapa Nehemia chuan Davida thlân zâwn leh dîl khuah leh mi huaisente in thlengin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dawt chu Levi-hovin an siam ṭha a, Bania fapa, Rehuma te hovin. A dawt chu Keila bial chanve hotu Hasabia chuan ama bial hmingin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dawt chu an unauten an siam ṭha a, Keila bial chanve hotu Henadada fapa Bavaia-tehovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, a dawt chu Mizpa hotu Jesua fapa Ezera chuan hmun dang, kulh kawi ṭannaa râlthuam dahna pan chhohna zâwn a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A dawt chu Zabaia fapa Baruka chuan ṭhahnemngai takin hmun dang, kulh kawi ṭanna aṭanga puithiam lal Eliasiba in kawngkhâr thlengin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A dawt chu Hakoza fa, Uria fapa Meremothan hmun dang, Eliasiba in kawngkhâr aṭanga Eliasiba in tâwp thlengin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, a dawt chu a chheh vêla puithiamhovin an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Anni dawt chu Benjamina leh Hasuban an in zâwn chu an siam ṭha a. An dawt chu Anania fa Maaseia fapa Azarian a in kiang a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A dawt chu Henadada fapa Binuian hmun dang, Azaria in aṭanga kulh kawi ṭanna, a kil thlengin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Uzaia fapa Palala chuan kulh kawi ṭanna zâwn leh tân in kianga lal in chungnung zâwk aṭanga lawr in sâng zâwn a siam ṭha a. A dawt chu Parosa fapa Pedaian a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />(Nethin-ho chu chhak lampanga Tui Kawngkhâr zâwn thleng leh in sâng lawr thlengin Ophel-ah an awm a.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A dawt chu Teko-hovin hmun dang, in sâng lian pui lawr zâwn leh Ophel kulh thlengin an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sakawr Kawngka chung lam chu puithiamhoten mahni in zâwn ṭheuh an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Anni dawt chu Imera fapa Zadokan a in zâwn a siam ṭha a. Tin, a dawt chu chhak lam kawngkhâr vêngtu Sekania fapa Semaian a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A dawt chu Selemia fapa Hanania leh Zalapha fapa parukna Hanuna-te chuan hmun dang an siam ṭha a. A dawt chu Berekia fapa Mesulaman a awmna zâwn a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A dawt chu rangkachak chhertu zînga mi Malkija chuan Hamipkad Kawngkhâr zâwn Nethin-ho in leh sumdâwngho in thleng leh a kil pan chhohna thlengin a siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, a kil pan chhohna leh a Berâm Kawngka inkâr chu rangkachak chhertu leh sumdâwnghoten an siam ṭha a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nimahsela, heti hi a ni a, Sanbalatan kulh kan siam tih a han hriat chuan a thinur a, nasa takin a thin a tirim a, Juda-te a chêksawlh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tichuan, a unaute leh Samari sipaite hmaah chuan thu a sawi a, “Hêng Juda mi chhiaṭhahote hian eng nge maw an tih le? Khawpui sak ṭhat an tum em ni vei le? An inthawi tehlul ang maw? Ni khat thil thûah an puitlin tehlul ang maw? Bawlhhlawh awm khâwm mai mai ata lung kâng chhe tawh si an din thar leh ang maw?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, a kianga Amon mi Tobia chuan, “Han din teh rêng se; sihal pawh han lâwn sela an lung kulh chu a tichim mai ang chu,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw kan Pathian, ngai teh, hmuhsitin kan awm hi; an mi sawichhiatna chu anmahni lû chungah lêttîr la, anni pawh khawii ramah emaw mualpho takin tântîr reng ang che!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An bawhchhiatna chu khuh suh la, an sualnate chu i hma ata thai bovin awmtîr suh ang che; kulh siamtute hmaah an tihthinur che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, kulh chu kan siam a; a sân lam chanvein kulh zawng zawng chu kan zawm chhuak vek a; mipuite chuan thawh châkna rilru an pu hle mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, heti hi a ni a, Sanbalata te, Tobia te, Arab mite, Amon mite leh Asdod miten Jerusalem kulh chu siam ṭhat a ni zêl tih leh, a chhe laite kan thawm ṭan tih an hriat chuan an thinur ta hle mai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tichuan, Jerusalem chu rawn beiha buaina rawn siam an phiar tlâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, anmahni avângin kan Pathian hnênah kan ṭawngṭai a, chhûn leh zânah an laka vêngtu kan dah reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Juda chuan, “Thawktute tha a chau zo tawh a, bawlhhlawh lah a nasa si a; kulh chu kan siam thei dâwn ta lo a nih hi,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kan hmêlmate lah chuan, “An zînga kan han kala, kan han thaha, hna chu kan han tihtâwpsak hma chuan an hre lo vang a, min hmu hek lo vang,” an lo ti bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Juda mi an kianga chêngte chuan kan hnêna lo kalin kan hmêlmate min phiarna chu min hrilh fo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan kulh phên, a hniam lai ber, hmun thawthâwl takahte mipuite chu a chhûng chhûngin an khandaih te, an fei te, an thal ngulte kengin ṭanhmun ka khuartîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, ka han en vêl a, ka tho va, mi ṭhate leh rorêltute leh mipui dangte hnênah chuan, “Anmahniho chu hlau hauh suh ula, Lalpa ropui tak leh hlauhawm tak mai chu hre rengin in unaute, in fapate, in fanute, in nupuite, in inte hum tûrin bei rawh u,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kan hmêlmaten kan lo hria tih leh, an thiltih tum chu Pathianin eng mah lovah a siam tih an hriatin, kulh lamah mahni hnathawhna ṭheuhvah kan kal leh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, chuta chin chu kan tlangvâlho zâtvete chuan hna an thawk a; tin, a zâtvete chuan feite, phawte, thal ngulte, âwmphawte chu an kawl a; tin, rorêltu chuan Juda chhûngte, kulh siamtu zawng zawngte chu an ṭan tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kulh siamna tûr hmanraw phurtute pawhin an kut khing khatin hna an thawk a, khing khatin hriamhrei an keng a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a siamtute chuan an khandaih an pai ṭheuh va, chutiang chung chuan an siam a ni. Tin, tawtawrâwt hâmtu chu ka kiangah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, mi ṭhate leh rorêltute leh mipuite hmaah chuan, “Hna chu a nasain a zau êm mai a, kulhah hian kan darhsarhin kan inhlat hle mai si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />tawtawrâwt ri in hriatna lam apiangah chuan, chutah chuan kan hnênah lo tlân khâwm ula; kan Pathianin min dosak ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutiang chuan hna chu kan thawk a; tin, a zâtve chuan khawfîng chah aṭangin arsi lan thlengin feite chu an kawl reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin chumi lai vêk chuan mipuite hnênah, “Zâna min vênga chhûnlâwna hnathawk atân tu pawh an chhiahhlawhte nên Jerusalem chhûngah riak vek rawh se,” ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chutichuan, kei pawh, ka unaute pawh, ka tlangvâlte pawh, vêngtu mi zui ṭhînte pawh, tu mah rêng rêngin kan silhfên kan hlîp lo va, hriamhrei inbel chung ṭheuhvin tui lamah chuan kan kal ta ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite leh an nupuite chu an unau Juda-te chunga phunnawiin an au ta mur mur mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Keiniho hi kan fapate leh kan fanute nên kan ṭhahnem hle a, ei tûr lamah hian kan hautak hle si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ṭhenkhatin, “Kan tam si a, ei tûr kan nei lo. Kan lote kan dahkham si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Lal hnêna chhiah chawi atân sum kan pûk a, chumi atân chuan kan lote leh kan grêp huante kan dahkham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan tisa chu kan unaute tisa ang bawk a ni a, kan fate pawh an fate ang bawk an ni si a; nimahsela, hei, kan fanute leh kan fapate hi chhiahhlawh atâna bâwihah kan luhtîr takngial dâwn hi; kan fanu ṭhenkhat phei chu bâwihah an lût tawh nghe nghe a. Chhan ngaihna hre hek lo i, miin kan lote leh kan grêp huante lah chu an nei ta si a,” tite an awm nual bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thûte leh an au thâwm chu ka hriatin ka thinur hle mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka rilruin ka ngaihtuah a, mi ṭhate leh rorêltute chu ka khak a, an hnênah, “Mi tinin in unaute a pung ûmin sum in pûktîr rêng mai a,” ka ti a. Tin, an chungchâng ngaihtuah tûrin mi ka khâwm chiam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, an hnênah, “Hnam dangte hnêna hralh kan unau Juda-hote chu kan theih ang angin kan tlan a. Nangnin in unaute chu zawrh in tum a ni maw? Keini hnênah kher hian hralh an ni dâwn em ni?” ka ti a. Chutichuan, an ngawi reng mai a, chhân ngaihna rêng an hre lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“In thiltih hi a ṭha tawp lo mai. Kan hmêlma, hnam dangte mi sawichhiatna avângte hian kan Pathian ṭiha in awm a ṭûl a ni lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei leh ka unaute leh ka tlangvâlte pawhin chutianga a pung ûm chuan kan sum leh buh kan pûktîr ve bawk asin. A pung ûma pûktîr hi i bân teh daih ang u khai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawiinah ngei hian an lote, an grêp huante, an olive huante, an inte leh an sum leh an buh leh an uain leh hriak hmun zaa hmun khat in lâk ṭhin pawh chu pe leh vek rawh u khai,” ka ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, anni chuan, “Kan pe leh vek ang, an lakah eng mah kan phût lo vang; i tih ang tak chuan kan ti ang,” an ti a. Chutichuan, puithiamte ka ko va, an hmaah chumi thutiam ang taka ti ngei tûr chuan chhia ka chhamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka puan ven chu ka thing a, “Hemi thutiam anga ti lo apiang hi Pathianin a in aṭang leh a hnathawh aṭangin hetiang hian thing thla rawh se; hetianga thin thlâk hian awm sela, tihruahin awm rawh se,” ka ti a. Tin, pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan, “Amen,” an ti a, Lalpa an fak a. Tin, mipuite chuan chumi thutiam ang chuan an ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Judai rama anmahni awptu atâna ruat ka nih achin, Lal Artazerzia kum sawmhnih a lal kum aṭanga kum sawmthum leh kum hnih a lal kum thleng, kum sâwm leh pahnih chhûng chuan kei leh ka unaute hian ram awptu buh chhiah kan la lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, tûn hmaa ram awptute kha mite lakah an lo hautak hle mai a, tangkarua sakel sawmli tiam lovin an chhangte leh uainte an lâksak ṭhîn a. Chumi ahnuhmanah an chhiahhlawhte chu mite chungah an intilal hle mai a; nimahsela, kei zawngin Pathian ṭihna avângin chutiang chuan ka ti ve lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ni, hemi kulh hna thawk hian ka awm reng a, ram rêng rêng lei pawh ka lei lo. Ka tlangvâlho zawng zawng pawh hna chu thawkin chutah chuan an awm khâwm reng bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu chang pawh ni lovin, kan vêla hnam dangte zîng aṭanga lo kal tiam lovin, Juda-te leh rorêltute zînga ka dawhkân kîl mi za leh sawmnga an awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tin, ni khat atâna an buatsaih chu sebâwngpa pakhat leh berâm paruk a ṭha ṭhiau a ni a; tin, ârte pawh ka tân an buatsaih a, ni sâwm dan zêlah uain chi hrang hrang tam zet nên. Chutiang chuan buatsaih mah sela, he mite tuar hi a rip êm avângin ram awptu pual chhang chu ka phût lo rêng rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, he mite tâna ka thiltih zawng zawng hi ka ṭhatna tûrin hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Sanbalata leh Tobia leh Arab mi Gesema leh kan hmêlma dang rêng rêngten kulh te ka siam a, a pawp lai rêng rêng a awm ta lo tih an han hriat chuan (amaherawhchu, chumi lai chuan kawngkaah chuan kawngkhârte ka la rel lo va),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sanbalata leh Gesema chuan, “Lo kal la, Ono phaia khaw pakhatah i intâwk khâwm teh ang u,” tiin thu min rawn thawn a. Nimahsela, ka chunga thil ṭha lo tih an tum a lo ni reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, keiin an hnênah, “Hna ropui tak ka thawk a, ka lo chhuk thei lo. Engah nge in hnêna ka rawn chhuksan hlânin hna chu a chawlh ang?” tiin mi ka tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chutiang hlîr chuan vawi li thu mi rawn thawn a, chutiang hlîr chuan ka chhâng bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Sanbalata chuan chutiang bawkin a vawi nganaah chuan a chhiahhlawh lehkha châr loh kengin ka hnênah a rawn tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumiah chuan, “Nang leh Juda-ho chuan hel in rilrûk a, chuvâng chuan kulh chu i siam a ni tih thu hnam dangte zîngah a thang a, Gasmua’n a sawi bawk a; tin, an sawi dân hmangah chuan nang hi an lal nih i tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, ‘Judai ramah chuan lal a awm,’ tia i chanchin Jerusalem-a puang vêl tûrin zâwlnei pawh i ruat tawh hial bawk a. Hêng thu hi lal hnênah an sawi thuai ngei ang a. Chuvângin, lo kal la, i lo inrâwn ang hmiang,” tih a chuang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, a hnênah, “I sawi ang rêng rêng hian eng mah tih a awm lo, i phuah chawp mai a ni,” tiin a hnênah mi ka tîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“An hnathawh chu an puitlin theih loh nân an kutte chu tihchak lohvin a awm ang,” tia mi sawiṭhaih duh vek an ni a. Chutichuan, aw Pathian, ka kutte hi min tihchaksak teh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chumi zawhah chuan Mehetabela fa Delaia fapa Semaia, chhuakvâk thei lova inah chuan ka kal a; tin, ani chuan, “Pathian inah, biak in chhûng ngeiah inhmu ang khai, biak in kawngte i khâr tlat ang, nangmah that tûrin an lo kal dâwn a ni; zânah rawn thah che an tum a ni,” a lo ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, kei chuan, “Keini ang hi han tlânchhe tûr em kan nih? Mahni nun humhim tûr pawhin biak inah tu nge lût duh ang? Ka lût tawp lo vang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ka han hre chhuak a, Pathian tirh a lo ni hauh lo mai a, keimah mi dodâlin chûng thu chu a sawi a lo ni zâwk a, Tobia leh Sanbalatan an rawih a lo ni reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hlauhva, chutianga ka tiha, thil ka tihsuala, mi tihhmingchhiatna tûr an neih theiha min sawi chhiat nân an rawih a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, Tobia leh Sanbalata hi an thiltih ang zêl hian hre reng ang che, zâwlneinu Noadii leh zâwlnei dang, mi tihhlauh tum zawng zawng nên hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, kulh chu ni sawmnga leh ni hnihah, Elul thla, ni sawmhnih leh ni nga nîah peih a ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kan hmêlma zawng zawngten chu chu an lo hriat chuan kan vêla hnam dangte chuan an hlau ta a, chan chhe ta hlein an inhria a, hna chu kan Pathian thawh a ni tih an hre ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chu lo rêngah pawh, chûng lai chuan Juda mi ṭhate chuan Tobia chu lehkha tam tak an thawn ṭhîn a; tin, Tobia lehkha pawh an hmu bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ani chu Ara fapa Sekania mâkpa a nih avângin Judai rama mi tam tak chhechhama amah thurualpui an awm a; tin, a fapa Jehohanana chuan Berekia fapa Mesulama fanu chu nupuiah a nei a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hriatah a thiltih ṭhatte an sawi ṭhîn a, ka thusawite a hnênah an thlen bawk ṭhîn. Tichuan, Tobia chuan min tihṭhaih tûrin lehkhate a rawn thawn ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, kulhte kan siama, kawngkhârte kan rela, kawngkhâr vêngtute, hla satute, Levi-hote ruat an nih zawh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka unau Hanania leh kulhbîng hotu Hanania chu Jerusalem ka awptîr a; mi rinawm tak, mi ahluana Pathian ṭih mi a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem kulh kawngkhârte hi ni a tlângsân fe hma chu hawng suh u, tlaiah, vêngtute an ṭîn hmain khâr sela, kalh vek rawh se. Tin, Jerusalem-a awmte zînga mi, vêngtute ruat ula, an awmna tûr ruatah awm sela, a ṭhen erawh chuan mahni in bul vêl an vêng ṭheuh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua chu a zauvin a lian hle a; nimahsela, a mi awmte an tlêm hle mai a, inte pawh la sak loh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, ka Pathianin ka rilruah, mi ṭhate, rorêltute, mipuite ko khâwm veka, an thlahtute ang zêla chhiar tûrin mi hriattîr a. Tin, a tîr taka kal chhote thlahtute hming ziakna bu chu ka hmu chhuak a, chutah chuan hetianga ziak ka hmu a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />sala hruai, Babulon lal Nebukadnezzaran a hruaite zînga sala tâng chhuak, Jerusalem leh Judai rama mahni khua ṭheuhva haw leha, chumi rama awm tate chu hêngte hi an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zerubabela te, Jesua te, Nehemia te, Azaria te, Raamia te, Nahamania te, Mordekaia te, Bilsana te, Misperetha te, Bigvaia te, Nehuma te, Baana te rual hian an kal a ni. Israel-ho zînga mi vântlâng tam lam chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Parosa thlahte sânghnih leh za leh sawmsarih leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sephatia thlahte zathum leh sawmsarih leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ara thlahte zaruk leh sawmnga leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jesua leh Joaba thlahte zînga Pahath-moaba thlahte sânghnih leh zariat leh sawm leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Elama thlahte sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmnga leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zatua thlahte zariat leh sawmli leh panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zakaia thlahte zasarih leh sawmruk;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Binuia thlahte zaruk leh sawmli leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bebaia thlahte zaruk leh sawmhnih leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azgada thlahte sânghnih leh zathum leh sawmhnih leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Adonikama thlahte zaruk leh sawmruk leh pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bigvaia thlahte sânghnih leh sawmruk leh pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Adina thlahte zaruk leh sawmnga leh panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hezekia thlaha mi Atera thlahte sawmkua leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hasuma thlahte zathum leh sawmhnih leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bezaia thlahte zathum leh sawmhnih leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Haripha thlahte za leh sâwm leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Gibeona thlahte sawmkua leh panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Bethlehem leh Netopha khuaa mi za leh sawmriat leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anathoth khuaa mi za leh sawmhnih leh pariat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Beth-azmavet khuaa mi sawmli leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kiriath-jearim te, Kephira te leh Beerot khuaa mite zasarih leh sawmli leh pathum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rama leh Geba khuaa mi zaruk leh sawmhnih leh pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mikma khuaa mi za leh sawmhnih leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bethel leh Ai khuaa mi za leh sawmhnih leh pathum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nebo danga mi sawmnga leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Elam dang khaw chhuak thlahte sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmnga leh pali;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Harim khaw chhuak thlahte zathum leh sawmhnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Jeriko khaw chhuak thlahte zathum leh sawmli leh panga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lod leh Hadid te leh Ono khaw chhuak thlahte zasarih leh sawmhnih leh pakhat;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Sena khaw chhuak thlahte sângthum leh zakua leh sawmthum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Puithiamte - Jesua chhûngte zînga mi Jedaia thlahte zakua leh sawmsarih leh pathum;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Imera thlahte sângkhat leh sawmnga leh pahnih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Pasura thlahte sângkhat leh zahnih leh sawmli leh pasarih;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Harima thlahte sângkhat leh sawm leh pasarih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Levi-hote - Hodeva thlaha mi Jesua leh Kadmiela thlahte sawmsarih leh pali.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hla satute - Asapha thlahte za leh sawmli leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Kawngkhâr vêngtute - Saluma thlahte, Atera thlahte, Talmona thlahte, Akuba thlahte, Hatita thlahte, Sobaia thlahte za leh sawmthum leh pariat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Nethin-ho - Ziha thlahte, Hasupha thlahte, Tabaotha thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Kerosa thlahte, Sia thlahte, Padona thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lebana thlahte, Hagaba thlahte, Salmaia thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hanana thlahte, Gidela thlahte, Gahara thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Reaia thlahte, Rezina thlahte, Nekoda thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Gazama thlahte, Uza thlahte, Pasea thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Besaia thlahte, Meunima thlahte, Nephisesima thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Bakbuka thlahte, Hakupha thlahte, Harhura thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Bazlitha thlahte, Mehida thlahte, Harsa thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Barkosa thlahte, Sisera thlahte, Tema thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nezia thlahte, Hatipha thlahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Solomona chhiahhlawhte thlah: Sotaia thlahte, Sopheretha thlahte, Perida thlahte;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Jaala thlahte, Darkona thlahte, Gidela thlahte,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Sephatia thlahte, Hatila thlahte, Pokereth-hazebaima thlahte, Amona thlahte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Nethin mi zawng zawng leh Solomona chhiahhlawhte thlah chu zathum leh sawmkua leh pahnih an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Tin, Tel-mela te, Tel-harsa te, Kerub te, Adon te, Imer aṭangtea lo chhote chu hêngho hi an ni a; nimahsela, an pi leh pute chhûngte leh an thlah zêlte Israel mi an nih leh nih loh an chhui thei lo va:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Delaia thlahte, Tobia thlahte, Nekoda thlahte zaruk leh sawmli leh pahnih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte zînga mi: Hobaia thlahte, Hakoza thlahte, Gilead mi Barzilaia fanu zînga mi nupuia neia, an hming pu ta nghâl Barzilaia thlahte chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />chûngho chuan an thlahtute ang zêla chhiarte zîngah chuan an hming ziakna an zawng a; nimahsela, an hmu lo va; chuvângin, bawlhhlawha ngaihin an awm a, an puithiam nihna chu an bân a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tin, ram awptu chuan anni chu Urim leh Thumim inbela puithiam a din hma loh chuan thil serhte chu an ei tûr a ni lo tih a hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Mipui pung khâwm zawng zawng chu sîngli leh sânghnih leh zathum leh sawmruk an ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />an chhiahhlawh hmeichhia leh mipa sângsarih leh zathum sawmthum leh pasarih tiam lovin; tin, hla satu hmeichhia leh mipa zahnih leh sawmli leh panga an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />An sakawr chu zasarih leh sawmthum leh paruk a ni a, sabengtung lian chi chu zahnih leh sawmli leh panga a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />an sanghâwngsei chu zali leh sawmthum leh panga a ni a, an sabengtung chu sângruk leh zasarih leh sawmhnih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Tin, chhûngkaw puipa ṭhenkhatten chumi hna atân chuan thil an thawh a. Ram awptu chuan thawhlâwmah rangkachak darik sângkhat, maihûn sawmnga, puithiam silhfên zanga leh sawmthum a thawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Tin, chhûngkaw puipa ṭhenkhatten in sakna thawhlâwmah rangkachak darik sînghnih leh tangkarua bûk sânghnih leh zahnih an thawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Tin, mi dang zawng zawng pêk chu rangkachak darik sînghnih leh tangkarua bûk sânghnih leh puithiam silhfên sawmruk leh pasarih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Tichuan, puithiamte, Levi-hote, kawngkhâr vêngtute, hla satute leh mi ṭhenkhatte leh, Nethin-ho leh Israel mi zawngte chu mahni khua khuaah an awm ta a. Chutichuan, thla sarihna a lo thlen chuan Israela thlahte chu an khuaahte chuan an awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, mi zawng zawng chu thu khat vuain Tui Kawngkhâr hmazâwn hmun zau laiah chuan an kal khâwm a; tin, lehkhaziaktu Ezra chu Lalpan Israel-hote zawm tûra thu a pêk, Mosia dân bu chu rawn keng tûrin an hrilh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, thla sarihna ni khat nîah puithiam Ezra chuan pung khâwmho, nutling patling leh a hre thiam thei chin zawng zawng hmaah chuan dân chu a rawn keng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, chuta mi chu Tui Kawngkhâr hmazâwn hmun zau laiah chuan, nutling patling leh a hre thiam thei chinte hmaah chuan zîng tak aṭangin chhûn thlengin a chhiar a; tin, mi zawng zawng chuan dân bu thûah chuan an beng an chhi ṭhup mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, chutiang atâna an siam rêng thing dawhkân sângah chuan lehkhaziaktu Ezra chu a ding a; tin, a sîr ding lamah chuan Matithia te, Sema te, Anaia te, Uria te, Hilkia te, Maaseia te an ding a; tin, a vei lamah chuan Pedaia te, Misaela te, Malkija te, Hasuma te, Hasbadana te, Zekaria te, Mesulama te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, Ezra chuan mi zawng zawng mit hmuhah chuan lehkhabu zial chu a han phelh a (mi zawng zawng aia sânga ding a ni a); tin, a han phelh chuan mi zawng zawng chu an ding ta vek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tichuan, Ezra chuan Lalpa , Pathian ropui tak chu a fak a. Tin, mipui zawng zawng chuan an bân pharin, “Amen, Amen!” tiin an lo chhâwn a. Tin, an kûn a, an hmaia lei siin Lalpa chu chibai an bûk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Jesua te, Bania te, Serebia te, Jamina te, Akuba te, Sabethaia te, Hodija te, Maaseia te, Kelita te, Azaria te, Jozabada te, Hanana te, Pelaia te, Levi-hote chuan mipuite chu dân an hrilhfiah a; mipuite chu an dinhmunah chuan an awm reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, lehkhabu, Pathian dân bua mi chu fiah takin an chhiar a; a awmzia an hrilhfiah a; tichuan, an chhiar chu an hriat chiantîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, ram awptu Nehemia leh, puithiam leh lehkhaziaktu ni fâwm Ezra leh mipuite zirtîrtu Levi-hote chuan mipui zawng zawng hnênah chuan, “Vawiin hi Lalpa in Pathian tâna ni thianghlim a ni a; lungchhe suh ula, ṭap hek suh u,” an ti a. Dân thu chu an hriatin mipui zawng zawng chu an ṭap an ṭap mai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan an hnênah, “Kal ula, thil thau eiin thil thlum in ula, eng mah buatsaih nei lote tân chanpual thawn ang che u; vawiin hi kan Lalpa tâna ni thianghlim a nih hi. Lungngaiin awm suh u; Lalpa chunga lâwmna chu in chakna a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levi-hote chuan, “Ngawi hle hle rawh u, vawiin hi ni thianghlim a ni si a; lungngaih pawh lungngai duh suh u,” tiin mipui zawng zawng chu an tingawi ta ṭhuap mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, thu a hrilhfiah chu an hriat thiam avângin mipui zawng zawng chu ei tûr te, in tûr te, mi dang chanpual thawn tûr te, hlim taka awm tûr tein an ṭîn ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, a ni hnih ni chuan mipui zawng zawng zînga chhûngkaw puipa te, puithiam te, Levi-hote chu dân thu zir tûr bawk chuan lehkhaziaktu Ezra hnênah an kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, Lalpan Mosia hmanga zawm tûra thu a pêk dânah chuan, thla sarihna kût laia Israela thlahte chhâwl bûka an awm tûr thu ziak an hmu a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tlângah kal ula, olive zâr te, olive suak zâr te, lênhmui zâr te, tûm kau te, thing lian tak tak zârte chhâwl bûk sak nân va la rawh u,” tiin, an khua zawng zawngah leh Jerusalem khuaa an tlângthantîr tûr leh puan vêl tûr a nih thute an chhiar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chutichuan, mipuite chu an va kal a, an va la a, mi zawng zawngin an in chungah te, an kawtah te, Pathian in kawtah te, Tui Kawngkhâr hmun zau laiah te, Ephraim kawngkhâr hmun zau laiah te chhâwl bûk an insiam ṭheuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, sal chhuak pung khâwmho zawng zawng chuan chhâwl bûk an siam a, chhâwl bûkahte chuan an awm a. Nuna fapa Josua hun aṭanga chumi ni thleng chuan Israela thlahte chuan chutiang tak chuan an ti ngai lo va. Tichuan, lâwmna nasa tak a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ni tin, a ṭan tirh ni aṭanga a tâwp thlengin Pathian dân bua mi a chhiar bawk a. Tin, ni riat ni chu kût ṭiak ni a ni a, thupêk angin inkhâwmna urhsûn takin an titâwp ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chutichuan, chumi thla ni sawmhnih leh ni li ni chuan Israela thlahte chu chaw ngheia saiip puan sinin, lei kai luamin an kal khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tin, Israel hnam chu hnam dangte lakah an intihrang a, an ding a, an sualnate leh an pi leh pu bawhchhiatnate thupha an chawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, mahni hmun hmunah an ding a, chumi ni hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat chhûng chuan Lalpa an Pathian dân bu an chhiar a; tin, hmun lia ṭhena hmun khat dang chhûng chuan thupha an chawi a, Lalpa an Pathian an bia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levi-ho dawhkân sângah chuan Jesua te, Bania te, Kadmiela te, Sebania te, Bunia te, Serebia te, Bania te, Kenania te chu an ding a, ring takin Lalpa an Pathian an au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutichuan, Levi mi, Jesua leh Kadmiela te, Bania te, Hasabneia te, Serebia te, Hodia te, Sebania te leh Pethahia te chuan, “Ding ula, Lalpa in Pathian chu chatuan ata chatuan thlengin fak rawh u,” an ti a. “Chawimawina leh fakna zawng zawngina a phâk loh, i hming ropui chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa , nangmah chauh hi Lalpa i ni a, vânte vân leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte nên, leilung leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte nên, tuifinriat leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawngte nên i siam a, a zain i vawng ṭha ṭhîn a; tin, vâna awmhote chuan chibai an bûk ṭhîn che a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abrama chu thlanga, Kaldai ram Ur khua ata hruai chhuaka, a hminga Abrahama saksaktu Lalpa Pathian i ni a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tin, a thinlung chu i hmaah rinawmin i hria a, Kanaan-hote, Hit-hote, Amor-hote, Periz-hote, Jebus-hote, Girgas-hote ram chu pe tûrin, a thlahte lam pe tûrin thu i thlung a; tin, i thu i hlen bawk a; fel tak i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Aigupta rama kan pi leh pute hrehawmzia chu i hmu reng a, Tuifinriat Sen kama an au thâwmte chu i hria a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pharaoa leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte leh a rama mi zawng zawngte chungah chhinchhiahnate leh thilmakte i lantîr a; chapo takin an chungah thil an ti tih i hre si a; tichuan, tûn thleng hian hming i insiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tin, an hmaah tuifinriat chu i tiṭhen a; tichuan, lei chârah tuifinriat chu an kal tlang a; tin, anmahni ûmtute chu tui thûk takah, tui thûk taka lung paih luh ang maiin i paih lût a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, chhûnah chhûm dingin i hruai ṭhîn a, zânah pawh an kalna tûr kawnga anmahni ên tûrin mei alh dingin i hruai ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Sinai tlângah chuan i lo chhuk bawk a, vân aṭangin an hnênah thu i sawi a, rorêlna dik tak te, dân dik tak te, thuruat leh thupêk ṭha takte i pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tin, i Chawlhni thianghlim chu anmahni i hriattîr a, i chhiahhlawh Mosia hmangin thupêk te, thuruat te, dân te i pe a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tin, an rilṭâm tihreh nân vân aṭangin chhang i pe a, an tuihâl tihreh nân lungpui ata tui i tihchhuahsak a, pêk i tum ram chu luah tûrin i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, anni leh kan pi leh pute chuan chapo takin thil an ti a, an intiluhlul a, i thupêkte chu an pawm lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />an âwih duh lo va, an zînga i thilmak tihte pawh chu an hre duh tawh hek lo; an intiluhlul a, an helin an bâwih nihna lama lêt leh tûrin hotu an ruat ta zâwk a. Nimahsela, nang chu ngaidam tûra inpeih reng Pathian, mi khawngaih thei, lainatnaa khat, thinnel, ngilneihna ngah i ni a, anmahni i thlahthlam chuang lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni, bâwngno lem an insiam a, ‘Hei hi a ni, Aigupta ram ata hruai chhuaktu che u in pathian chu,’ an tiha, thinurthlâk tak thil an tih laite pawh khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />i ngilneihna nasa tak chuan thlalêrah khân i thlahthlam chuang lo va. Kawnga anmahni hruai tûra an chunga chhûm ding chuan chhûnah a kalsan lo va, anmahni ên tûr leh an kalna tûr kawng kawhhmuh tûra mei alh ding pawh chuan zânah a kalsan hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anmahni zirtîr tûrin i thlarau ṭha tak chu i pe bawk a, i manna chuan i châwm a, an tuihâl tihreh nân tui i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ni, thlalêrah khân kum sawmli i châwm a, eng mah an tlachham lo va; an silhfênte a hlui lo va, an kete chu a vûng lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, ram leh hnamte i pe a, chûng chu an chanpual i sem ṭheuh va. Chutichuan, Sihona ram, Hesbon lalram leh Basan lal Oga ram chu an luah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An thlahte chu vâna arsi zâtin i tipung bawk a, an luah tûra an pi leh pute hnêna i lo sawi tawh ramah chuan i hruai lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chutichuan, an thlahte chuan ram chu an luah ta a; tin, nangin chumi rama awm Kanaan mite chu an hmaah i titlâwm a, an duh duha tih atân an lalte leh chumi rama mite nên an kutah i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kulh nei khawpuite, ram ṭha tak takte an la a, thil ṭha tinrênga khat inte an luah a, tuikhur hiah sa te, grêp huan te, olive huan te, thei kûng tam takte an nei a. Tichuan, an ei a, an puar a, an lo thau va, i ṭhatna nasa takah chuan nuam an chên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nimahsela, an tihmawh a, i chungah an hel a, i dân chu an hnuchhawn daih a, i lam hawi lehtîr tuma zilhtu i zâwlneite chu an that a, thinurthlâk tak tak thil an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan anmahni tihrehawmtu an hmêlmate kutah chuan i pe a; an mangan laia an auh che khân vân aṭangin i lo ngaithla a; tin, i ngilneihna nasa tak chuan an hmêlmate laka chhan chhuaktu tûr chhandamtute i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Nimahsela, râlmuanga an han awm hnu chuan, i mit hmuhah thil ṭha lo an ti leh mai a. Chuvângin, an hmêlmate kutah i pe a; tichuan, an chungah thu an nei a; mahse, an inlamlêta an auh che khân vân aṭangin i lo ngaithla a; vawi tam tak i ngilneihna chuan i chhan chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I dâna i hruai luh leh theih nân i zilh ṭhîn a; nimahsela, chapo takin thil an ti a, i thupêkte an pawm lo va, i rorêlna kalhin thil an tisual a (miin an zawma an nunpui tûr chu); tin, tukkhum chhah an chhawn a, an intiluhlul a, an ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nimahsela, kum tam tak anmahni i dawh a, i thlarauva i zâwlneite hmangin i zilh ṭhin a; nimahsela, an beng an chhu ngawng a; chuvângin, chûng rama mite kutah chuan i pe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Nimahsela, i ngilneihna nasa tak chuan an tâwp hlenna hlauh chu i thlensak lo va, i thlahthlam hek lo; Pathian, mi khawngaih thei tak, lainatnaa khat i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuvângin, kan Pathian, Pathian ropui, engkim ti thei leh hlauhawm, thuthlung hlena khawngaihna tilangtu chuan kan chung leh kan lalte, kan mi liante, kan puithiamte, kan zâwlneite, kan pi leh pute leh i mite zawng zawng chunga Assuria lalte lal lai aṭanga tûn thlenga hrehawmna lo thleng zozaite hi, thil tê thamah ngai suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />“Eng pawh ni sela, kan chunga thil lo thleng zawng zawngah hian nang chu i fel a; nang chuan dik takin thil i ti a, keini erawh chuan ṭha lo takin kan ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kan lalte, kan mi liante, kan puithiamte, kan pi leh pute pawhin i dân chu an zâwm lo va, i thupêk leh i thu hriattîr, anmahni i zilhnate chu an pawm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />An chunga i ṭhat ṭhin tehlul nên, an ramah, ram zau tak leh ram ṭha tak i pêkah chuan i rawng an bâwl lo va, an thil tihsual an bân chuang hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Ngai teh, tûnah hi chuan bâwih kan ni ta a, a chhûnga thil rah leh thil ṭha kan pi leh pute ei atân i pêk ramah hian bâwih kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kan sual avânga kan chunga lal atâna i ruatte lah chuan an neihnun phah a; kan taksa chungah leh kan ran chungahte lam pawh an duh duhin thu an nei a; kan mangang êm êm mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />“Chûng zawng zawng avâng chuan thu nghet tak kan thlung a, kan ziak a; kan mi liante, kan Levi-hote leh kan puithiamten min nemnghehpui a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tichuan, min nemnghehpuitute chu hêng hi an ni: Hakalia fapa, ram awptu Nehemia leh Zedekia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seraia te, Azaria te, Jeremia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasura te, Amaria te, Malkija te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatusa te, Sebania te, Maluka te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harima te, Meremotha te, Obadia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Daniela te, Ginethona te, Baruka te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mesulama te, Abija te, Mijamina te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maazia te, Bilgaia te, Semaia te: hêngho hi puithiam an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote: Azania fapa Jesua te, Henadada fate zînga mi Binuia te, Kadmiela te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tin, an unau Sebania te, Hodija te, Kelita te, Pelaia te, Hanana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mika te, Rehoba te, Hasabia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zakura te, Serebia te, Sebania te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hodia te, Bania te, Beninua te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipui hotute: Parosa te, Pahath-moaba te, Elama te, Zatua te, Bania te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bunia te, Azgada te, Bebaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Adonija te, Bigvaia te, Adina te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atera te, Hezekia te, Azura te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hodia te, Hasuma te, Bezaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Haripha te, Anathotha te, Nebaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Magpiasa te, Mesulama te, Hezira te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mesezabela te, Zadoka te, Jadua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pelatia te, Hanana te, Anaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hosea te, Hanania te, Hasuba te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hallohesa te, Pilha te, Sobeka te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rehuma te, Hasabna te, Maaseia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahia te, Hanana te, Anana te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Maluka te, Harima te, Baana te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, mi dang - puithiamte, Levi-hote, kawngkhâr vêngtute, hla satute, Nethin-hote leh Pathian dân zawm tuma chûng rama mite laka inthiarfihlîm zawng zawngte, an nupuite, an fapate, an fanute, chinchâng hre thei tawh chinte chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />an unaute, an mi liante chu an vuan tlat a, Pathian chhiahhlawh Mosia pêk Pathian dân zâwm tûra Lalpa , kan Lalpa thupêk zawng zawngte leh a rorêlnate leh a thuruatte chu zâwm leh vawnga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />chu rama mite chu kan fanute neihtîr lova, kan fapate tân an fanute nei hek lova,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />chu rama miten Chawlhnia thil zawrh tûr bungrua emaw, ei tûr rêng rêng zawrh tûr emaw an rawn lâka Chawlhni emaw, awmni kham ni emawa leisak lova, kum sarihnaa ram dah tuia leiba zawng zawng ṭhîng lo tûrin ânchhe dawn huamin chhia an chham a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tin, kan Pathian in lama rawngbâwlna atân sekel hmun thuma ṭhena hmun khat kum tina pêk tûrin dân kan insiam bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chhangdah atân te, chhangphut thilhlan fo tûr atân te, hâlral thilhlan fo tûr atân te, Chawlhni atân te, thla thar atân te, hunbi nei kût atân te, thil thianghlim atân te, Israel mite tâna inremna siamna tûra sual thawina atân leh kan Pathian in lama tih tûr zawng zawng tih nân te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Kan pi leh pute chhûngkua ang zêla kum tina hunbi ruata dân bua ziak anga, Lalpa kan Pathian maichâma hâl tûr thing hlan kan Pathian ina chhêktu tûr hriat nân puithiamho nên, Levi-ho nên, mipuite nên ṭhum kan vâwr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tin, kum tina kan lova thlai thar hmasa ber leh thing chi tinrêng rah hmasa ber Lalpa ina dah lût tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />dâna ziak anga kan fapa leh kan ran piang hmasa berte, kan bâwng rual leh berâm rual zinga piang hmasa berte pawh, kan Pathian ina rawngbâwltu puithiamte hnêna kan Pathian ina hruai tûr te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />kan Pathian in pindana puithiamte hnêna kan chhang hmeh hmasa ber te, kan thên thilhlan te, thing chi tinrêng rah te, uain leh hriak keng tûr te, kan lova mi sâwma pakhat Levi-hote pêk tûr tein dân kan insiam bawk a, anni Levi-hote chuan kan khaw zînga thlawhhma nei khua apiangah sâwma pakhat an la ṭhîn a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hoten sâwma pakhat an lâk laiin Arona thlah puithiam chu Levi-hote hnênah an awm tûr a ni a; Levi-hote chuan sâwma pakhat an lâk ata sâwma pakhat chu kan Pathian inah, ro dah khâwmna pindanah chuan an rawn dah tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Israela thlahte leh Levia thlahte chuan, buh leh uain leh hriak thên thilhlan chu hmun thianghlim bungbêl leh rawngbâwltu puithiamte, kawngkhâr vêngtute, hla satute awmna pindanah chuan an dah tûr a ni a; chutiang chuan a ni, kan Pathian in chu thlahthlam lo tûra dân kan insiam ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mipui hotute chu Jerusalem-ah an awm a; sâwm zînga pakhat zêl khawpui thianghlim Jerusalem-a awmtîr tûr leh, sâwm zînga pakua, khaw danga awm tûrte hriat nân a bâk mipuite pawh chuan ṭhum an vâwr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungni taka Jerusalem-a awm tûra inpe zawng zawngte chuan mipuite fak an hlawh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hêngte hi chumi ram hotu Jerusalem-a awmte chu an ni. Amaherawhchu, Judai ram khuaahte chuan, an khuaa mahni chan tûr ṭheuhvah an awm a; chûngte chu Israel-hote, puithiamhote, Levi-hote, Nethin-ho leh Solomona chhiahhlawhte thlah an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem-ah chuan Juda thlaha mi leh Benjamina thlaha mite an awm. Juda thlahte zînga mi: Pereza thlahte zînga mi, Mahalalela fapa Sephatia, chu mi fapa Amaria, chu mi fapa Zekaria, chu mi fapa Athaia, chu mi fapa Uzia leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silo mi fapa Zekaria, chu mi fapa Joiariba, chu mi fapa Adaia, chu mi fapa Hazaia, chu mi fapa Kol-hozea, chu mi fapa Baruka, chu mi fapa Maaseia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pereza thlah, Jerusalem-a awm zawng zawngte chu mi huaisen zali leh sawmruk leh pariat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte zînga mi chu hêngte hi an ni: Jesaia fapa Ithiela, chu mi fapa Maaseia, chu mi fapa Kolaia, chu mi fapa Pedaia, chu mi fapa Joeda, chu mi fapa Mesulama, chu mi fapa Salua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dawt lehah chuan Gabaia te, Salaia te, an zain Benjamina thlah Jerusalem-a awmte chu mi zakua leh sawmhnih leh pariat an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Zikria fapa Joela chu an hotu a ni; Hasenua fapa Juda chu khaw hotu ber dawttu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Puithiamte zînga mi: Joiariba fapa Jedaia te, Jakina te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian in hotu Ahituba fapa Meraiotha, chu mi fapa Zadoka, chu mi fapa Mesulama, chu mi fapa Hilkia, chu mi fapa Seraia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an unau, ina rawngbâwltute zawng zawng nên zariat leh sawmhnih leh pahnih an ni a; tin, Malkija fapa Pasura, chu mi fapa Zekaria, chu mi fapa Amzia, chu mi fapa Pelalia, chu mi fapa Jerohama, chu mi fapa Adaia leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a unaute, an chhûngkaw puipate nên zahnih leh sawmli pahnih an ni a; tin, Imera fapa Mesilemotha, chu mi fapa Ahzaia, chu mi fapa Azarela, chu mi fapa Amasaia leh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an unau mi chak huaisente nên za leh sawmhnih leh pariat an ni: an hotu chu Hagedolima fapa Zabdiela a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote zinga mi: Bunia fapa Hasabia, chu mi fapa Azrikama, chu mi fapa Hasuba, chu mi fapa Semaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Levi-ho puipate zînga mi Pathian in pâwn lam hna enkawltu Sabethaia leh Jozabada-te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asapha fapa Zabdia, chu mi fapa Mika, chu mi fapa, ṭawngṭaia lâwm thu sawi ṭantu ber Matania te; a unaute zînga a dawttu Bakbukia te; Jeduthuna fapa Galala, chu mi fapa Samua, chu mi fapa Abda te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khawpui thianghlima Levi-ho awm zawng zawng chu zahnih leh sawmriat leh pali an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chûng lote pawh chu kawngkhâr vêngtu Akuba te, Talmona te leh an unau kulh kawngka vêngtute, za leh sawmsarih leh pahnih an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A bâk Israel-te leh puithiamte leh Levi-hote chu Judai ram khaw tinah mahni ram ṭheuhvah an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nethin-ho erawh chu Ophel-ah an awm a. Ziha leh Gispa chu Nethin-ho hotu an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jerusalem khuaa Levi-hote hotu chu Asapha fa, hla satute zînga mi Mika, chu mi fapa Matania, chu mi fapa Hasabia, chu mi fapa Bania, chu mi fapa Uzia a ni a, Pathian in lam hna ngaihtuahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An chungchâng thûah lal thupêk a awm a, hla satute chu ni tina an tla tâwk ruat tûr thu a awm bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Juda fapa Zera thlaha mi Mesezabela fapa Pethahia chu mipuite chungchâng thûah engkima lal aiawh a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tin, an khua leh an ram thûah chuan, Juda thlah ṭhenkhatte chu Kiriath-arba leh a khawperah te, Dibon leh a khawperah te, Jekabzeel leh a khawperah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Jesua-ah leh Molada-ah leh Beth-pelet-ah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tin, Hazar-sual-ah te, Beer-seba leh an khawperah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ziglag-ah te, Mekona leh a khawperah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />En-rimon-ah te, Zora-ah te, Jarmuth-ah te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zanoa-ah te, Adulam-ah leh an khawperah te; Lakis leh a ramah te; Azeka leh a khawperah te an awm a. Chutichuan, Beer-seba aṭangin Hinom ruam thlengin awm hmun an khuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tin, Benjamina thlahte chu Geba piah lama Mikmas-ah te, Aija-ah leh Bethel leh a khawperah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anathoth-ah te, Nob-ah te, Anania-ah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hazor-ah te, Rama-ah te, Gitaim-ah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hadid-ah te, Zeboim-ah te, Neballat-ah te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lod-ah leh themthiamte ruam Ono-ah te an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tin, Judai rama awm ṭhîn Levi-ho pâwl ṭhenkhat chu Benjamin ramah an tel ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sealtiela fapa Zerubabela leh Jesua hnêna kal chho puithiamte leh Levi-hote chu hêngte hi an ni: Seraia te, Jeremia te, Ezra te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amaria te, Maluka te, Hatusa te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sekania te, Rehuma te, Meremotha te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Idova te, Ginethoia te, Abija te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mijamina te, Ma-adia te, Bilga te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Semaia te, Joiariba te, Jedaia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Salua te, Amoka te, Hilkia te, Jedaia te. Hêngho hi Jesua dam laia puithiam zîng leh an unaute zînga a hotute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng lo pawh Levi-hote: Jesua te, Binuia te, Kadmiela te, Serebia te, Juda te, lâwmthu sawinaa hotu Matania te, amah leh a unaute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bakbukia leh Unia leh an unaute pawh chu a pâwl pâwlin an inchhâwn ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Jesua chuan Joiakima a hring a, Joiakima chuan Eliasiba a hring a, Eliasiba chuan Joiada a hring a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Joiada chuan Jonathana a hring a, Jonathana chuan Jadua a hring a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, hêngho hi Joiakima dam lai chuan puithiam, an chhûngkaw puipate an ni: Seraia thlaha mi Meraia te; Jeremia thlaha mi Hanania te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ezra thlaha mi Mesulama te; Amaria thlaha mi Jehohanana te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Malukia thlaha mi Jonathana te; Sebania thlaha mi Josefa te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Harima thlaha mi Adna te; Meraiotha thlaha mi Helkaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Idova thlaha mi Zekaria te; Ginethona thlaha mi Mesulama te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abija thlaha mi Zikria te; Miniamina thlaha mi te, Moadia thlaha mi Piltaia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bilga thlaha mi Samua te; Semaia thlaha mi Jehonathana te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tin, Joiariba thlaha mi Matenaia te; Jedaia thlaha mi Uzia te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Salaia thlaha mi Kalaia te, Amoka thlaha mi Ebera te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hilkia thlaha mi Hasabia te; Jedaia thlaha mi Nethanela te.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Levia chite chungchângah chuan, Eliasiba te, Joiada te, Johanana te, Jadua te dam laiin chhûngkaw puipate chhinchhiah fel a ni a; chutiang bawkin puithiamte pawh Persia lal Daria lal thlengin chhinchhiah an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Eliasiba fapa Johanana dam lai thleng pawhin Levia fa, chhûngkaw puipate chu chanchin ziakna buah chuan an chuang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, Levi-ho puipate: Hasabia te, Serebia te, Kadmiela fapa Jesua te leh an unau, Pathian mi Davida thupêk anga a pâwl pâwla inchhâwna fak leh lâwmthu sawitu tûrte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Matania te, Bakbukia te, Obadia te, Mesulama te, Talmona te, Akuba te chu kawngkhâr kianga bungraw dah khâwmna in leh kawngka vêngtute an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hêngho hi Jesua, Jozadaka fapaa fapa Joiakima dam laia mi leh ram awptu Nehemia leh Ezra puithiam leh lehkhaziaktu dam laia mi an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem kulh an hlannaah chuan dârbenthekte, perhkhuangte, ṭingṭangte nêna hla sa leh lâwmthu sawia lâwm taka a hlannaa tel tûra Jerusalem-a rawn hruai tûrin, Levi-hote chu an hmun zawng zawng ata an zawng chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jerusalem chheh vêl ata leh Netophath-ho khuate aṭangin hla satuho fate an kal khâwm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Beth-gilgal aṭang leh Geba leh Azmavet ram atate pawh hla satute chuan Jerusalem vêlah chuan khua an lo siam ta hlawm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, puithiamte leh Levi-hote chu an intithianghlim a; tin, mipui te, kulh te, a kawngkhârte an tithianghlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda-ho mi liante chu kulh chungah chuan ka hruai chho va, lâwmthu sawia inzui duah duaha kal tûr pâwl lian tak pâwl hnih ka ruat a; pâwl khat chu kulh chung ding lam, Bawlhhlawh Kawngka lamah an kal a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tin, anni chu Hosaia leh Juda-ho mi lian zâtve te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Azaria te, Ezra te, Mesulama te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Juda te, Benjamina te, Semaia te, Jeremia te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />tawtawrâwt keng puithiam fapa ṭhenkhat te, Asapha fapa Zakura, chu mi fapa Mikaia, chu mi fapa Matania, chu mi fapa Semaia, chu mi fapa Jonathana, chu mi fapa Zekaria te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />a unau Semaia te, Azarela te, Milalaia te, Gilalaia te, Maaia te, Nethanela te, Juda te, Pathian mi Davida tum ṭhin thilte keng Hanania te chuan an zui a; tin, lehkhaziaktu Ezran an hma a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tin, Tuikhur Kawngka an thlenin, kulh chhoh ṭanna an hmazâwn Davida khaw kailâwna chhovin Davida in chhakah an kal a, chhak lampanga Tui Kawngka thleng rakin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Tin, lâwmthu sawitu pâwl dangte chu anmahni tâwk tûrin an kal a; tin, keiin mipui zâtvete nên Meipui Chhehna In sâng chhakah, kulh chungah Kulh Chhah thlengin kan zui a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ephraima Kawngka chungah te, Kawngka Hlui chungah te, Sangha Kawngka chungah te, Hananela In Sâng leh Hamea In Sâng chungah te, Berâm Kawngka thleng rakin; tin, Tân In Kawngkaah chuan an ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chutichuan, lâwmthu sawituho pâwl hnihte chu Pathian inah an ding a, kei leh rorêltu zâtvete nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />tin, tawtawrâwt keng puithiamho Eliakima te, Maaseia te, Miniamina te, Mikaia te, Elioenaia te, Zekaria te, Hanania te;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />tin, Maaseia te, Semaia te, Eleazara te, Uzia te, Jehohanana te, Malkija te, Elama te, Ezera te pawh. Tin, hla satute chuan an hotu Jezrahia hovin ring takin an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan inthawina nasa tak mai an hlân a, an hlim hle mai a; Pathianin hlim namên lohvin a tihlim a ni; tin, hmeichhiate leh naupangte chen pawhin an hlim hle mai a; chutichuan, Jerusalem hlimna chu hla tak aṭang pawhin an hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, chumi ni chuan thawhlâwm te, thên thilhlan te, thlai thar hmasa ber te, sâwma pakhat te dah khâwmna pindantea hotu, dânin a ruat ang, puithiam leh Levi-ho chanvo khaw tin lo zir ang zêla la khâwmtu tûrte an ruat a; Juda-te chu rawngbâwltu puithiamte leh Levi-ho avâng chuan an lâwm hle mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Davida leh a fapa Solomona thupêk angin, hla satute leh kawngkhâr vêngtute pawhin an Pathian rawngbâwl dân tûr leh intihthianghlimna dân chu an zâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hmânlaia Davida leh Asapha dam lai chuan hla sa pâwl hotu an awm ṭhîn a, Pathian fakna leh lâwmna hlate an sa ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Zerubabela dam lai leh Nehemia dam lai chuan, Israel zawng zawngin hla satute leh kawngkhâr vêngtute chu ni tina an tla tâwk tûr chanvo an siam ṭhîn a. Levi-ho chanvo a tihhransak bawk a; tin, anni Levi-hote chuan Arona fapate chanvo an tihhransak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan mipui beng hriatah Mosia lehkhabu an han chhiar a; tin, chumiah chuan Amon mite leh Moab mite chu, Pathian mite inkhâwmnaah chuan eng tikah mah an tel ve hauh lo tûr a ni tih a chuang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israela thlahte chhang leh tuia hmuak lova, anmahni ânchhe lawh tûra Balaama an rawih avâng khân. Nimahsela, kan Pathianin ânchhia chu malsâwmnaah a chantîr ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, dân chu an han ngaihthlâk zawh chuan Israel mite zîng ata a chawhpawlhtu hnam dang mite chu an tihrang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chumi hma chuan kan Pathian in pindantea hotu atâna ruat, puithiam Eliasiba, Tobia lamhnai chuan
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tûn hma lama Levi-hote, hla satute, kawngkhâr vêngtute chanvo, chhangphut thilhlan te, rimtui te, bungbêl te, buh sâwma pakhat te, uain leh hriak leh puithiamte tâna thên thilhlante an dah ṭhinna pindan zau tak Tobia a buatsaihsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nimahsela, chûng thil zawng zawng awm laite chuan Jerusalem khuaah ka awm lo va; Babulon lal Artazerzia kum sawmthum leh kum hnih a lal kumin lal hnênah ka kal a, ni eng emaw zât hnuah phalna ka dîl leh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tin, Jerusalem khuaah ka va kal a, Pathian in hung chhûng kawtlaitea pindan buatsaihsaka, Tobia tâna Eliasiban thil ṭha lo a tih chu ka han hre ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi tilungni lo êm êm mai a; chuvângin, Tobia in chhûng bungrua zawng zawng chu chumi pindan ata chu ka theh chhuak vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, thu ka pe a, pindante chu an thian fai a; tichuan, Pathian in bungbêlte chu chhangphut thilhlan te leh rimtui te nên ka la lût leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote leh hla satute chu an chan ai pêk an nih loh avângin mahni lo lam ṭheuhvah an tlân darh vek a ni tih ka hre leh ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, rorêltute ka khak a, “Engati nge Pathian in chu thlahthlam a nih reng mai le?” ka ti a. Tin, anni chu ka ko khâwm vek a, an hmun ṭheuhvah ka awmtîr leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda mi zawng zawng chuan buh sâwma pakhat te, uain te, hriak te chu thawhlâwm dah khâwmnaahte chuan an rawn la a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tin, puithiam Selemia leh lehkhaziaktu Zadoka leh Levi-ho zînga mi Pedaia-te chu thawhlâwm dah khâwmnate hotu atân ka siam a; anmahni puibâwmtuah chuan Matania fa Zakura fapa Hanana a awm a; rinawma ngaih an ni a, an hnathawh chu an unaute hnêna thil sem vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, hemi thûah hian min hre reng la, ka Pathian in leh a rawngbâwlna atâna ka thiltih ṭhatte chu thai bo lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Judai ramah Chawlhnia uain sâwr khurtea rap sâwr te, buhphal rawn phur te, uain te, grêp te, theipui te leh phurrit tinrêng phurhtîr tûra sabengtung siam laite ka hmu a; chûng chu Chawlhniah Jerusalem-ah an rawn phur lût a; ei tûr zawrh nite chuan a dik lohzia ka hriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tura rama mi chuta chêng vete pawhin sangha leh bungraw tinrêng an rawn la a, Chawlhniah Juda mite hnênah Jerusalem-ah an zuar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutichuan, Juda mi liante chu ka khak a, an hnênah, “Chawlhni tibawrhbânga in thil ṭha lo tih hi eng tizia nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />In pi leh pute pawh khân hetiang hi an ti a ni lâwm ni? Tin, kan Pathian chuan hêng thil ṭha lo zawng zawng hi kan chungah leh he khaw chungah hian a rawn thlentîr ta a ni lâwm ni? Chuti chung pawhin Chawlhni tibawrhbângin Israel mite chunga thinurna in la thlen belhtîr cheu mai ka ti,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, Chawlhni dâwna Jerusalem kulh kawngkhâr a thim deuh veleh kawngkhârte khâr tûrin thu ka pe a; tin, Chawlhni a ral hma loh chuan hawn loh tûrin thu ka pe bawk a. Chawlhnia thil phurh rêng rêng an lâk luh loh nân ka tlangvâl ṭhenkhat chu kawngkhâr ka vêntîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutichuan, sumdâwng mite leh bungraw tinrêng zuar mite chu vawi khat emaw, vawi hnih emaw chu Jerusalem pâwn lamah an riak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, a dik lohzia ka hriattîr a, an hnênah, “Engati nge kulh bulah in riah? Hetianga in tih leh chuan in chungah ka kut ka thlâk ang,” ka ti a. Chuta chin chu Chawlhni chuan an lo kal leh ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tin, Levi-hote chu inthian faia, Chawlhni tihthianghlimna tûra kulh kawngkhâr rawn vêng tûrin thu ka pe a. Aw ka Pathian, hemi thûah pawh hian min hre reng la, i khawngaihna nasa tak avângin min zuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chûng lai chuan Juda mi, Asdod hmeichhia te, Amon hmeichhia te, Moab hmeichhiate nupuia neite chu ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An fate zînga a zâtve chu Asdod ṭawngin an ṭawng a, chûngho ṭawng dân ang ang chauh lo chuan Juda ṭawngin an ṭawng thei lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu ka ko khawm a, ânchhia ka lawh a, ṭhenkhat chu ka vua a, an sam te ka pawh thlâksak a, an fanute chu chûngho fapate neihtîr lo tûr leh chûngho fanute chu an fapate tân emaw, anmahni tân emaw nei lo tûrin Pathian chhâlin chhia ka chhamtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Israel lal Solomona pawh kha hetiang thilahte hian a sual a ni lâwm ni? Chuti chung pawhin hnam tam tak zingah chuan amah ang lal an awm lo va, a Pathian mi duh tak a ni a, Pathianin Israel ram zawng zawng chunga lalah a siam bawk a; nimahsela, ani meuh pawh chu ram dang hmeichhiain a tisual ta mai a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chutichuan, ram dang hmeichhiate neia kan Pathian chunga thil ṭha lo tak mai hi ti tûrin in thu kan zâwm dâwn em ni?” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tin, puithiam lal Eliasiba fa, Joiada fapa pakhat chu Horon mi Sanbalata mâkpa a ni a; chuvângin, ka hnên aṭangin ka tlân botîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, puithiamna hna leh puithiamna hna thuthlung leh Levi-ho thuthlung an tihbawlhhlawh avângin hre reng hlawm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutiang chuan ram dang mite lakah ka tithianghlim a, puithiamte, Levi-hote tân an hnathawhna ṭheuhva an rawngbâwl dân tûr ka ruatsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a hun ruat ṭheuhva thing hlan atân leh thlai thar hmasa ber atânte nên. Aw ka Pathian, a ṭha lamin min hre reng ang che.
  </para>
</usx>
